msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse114_01188:TEXT_GAIUSE114_01188_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "<ui-color 533><ui-edge-color 534><icon 63> This quest has been adjusted. Please abandon the quest and restart it by speaking to Slafborn in Revenant's Toll.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※The Main Scenario Guide shows the next available quest. You can toggle it on and off in Character Configuration, under UI Settings."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ミンフィリアとウリエンジェによれば、双蛇党から新たな蛮神出現の報が入ったということだ。グリダニアの双蛇党：統合司令部にいる「ボルセル大牙佐」と話そう。
#. de: Urianger und Minfilia berichten dir, dass die Bruderschaft der Morgenviper das Erscheinen eines neuen Primae beobachtet hat. Mach dich schnell auf den Weg nach Gridania und sprich im Abaton der Bruderschaft mit dem Erleuchteten Prior Vorsaile. 
#. fr: Un nouveau Primordial a fait son apparition dans la Sylve des Douze. La signature éthérée détectée ressemblerait étrangement à celle d'une divinité s'étant manifestée peu avant le Fléau. Rendez-vous au quartier général de l'ordre des Deux Vipères à Gridania, et parlez au colonel Heuloix.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse114_01188:TEXT_GAIUSE114_01188_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Evidence suggests that a primal─or an entity resembling one─has been summoned in Gridania, and the Scions are duty-bound to investigate. High Serpent Commander Heuloix of the Order of the Twin Adder has requested you by name, and Minfilia bids you answer his summons. Make for the Adders' Nest with all haste."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ボルセル大牙佐と話すことができた。彼の言うところによれば、事態はなかなか深刻らしいが……。
#. de: Von Vorsaile erfährst du, wie ernst die Lage ist.  
#. fr: La voix de l'officier trahit son inquiétude. Quelle est donc cette nouvelle menace qui plane sur les Gridaniens...<nbsp>?
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse114_01188:TEXT_GAIUSE114_01188_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "You receive a warm welcome from the high serpent commander, who affirms his belief that you are the most qualified for the task at hand. Endeavor to live up to his high opinion and press him for further details."
msgstr ""

